<item>
<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-11-13T01:59:48.441Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 01:59:48 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Militant groups continue to launch lethal attacks against Pakistani security forces, with recent assaults killing ten police officers and 18 fighters in northwest Pakistan and another ambush causing similar casualties. In Khyber Pakhtunkhwa, police faced a clash that left eleven officers feared dead and a separate incident in Kohat that injured twelve personnel. Efforts to reopen borders for trade are ongoing, while a review of alleged war crimes in Afghanistan noted missing key photographic evidence. The conflict still accounts for 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTFBYZXhVMVhHeE1OV3BZLVB2ZjcwMW5DNHg0di03UG80MlNoUXEydlQzaVZDTm9oME9LejVXUnZ1T21pTVZRTElncw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxQdVV2UVNIbUR6RmluYTNfeGNyenZNTlB3cUhTQ0N5UktidTh6VWhuSXJJT0NmTHo3UXJaenppclRJZ0xJLUZfemo3SGI0b0xETVhjTUpMdV9adjBOU0VzS3VfNTRDYU1CRlFpMkpSV3FIcm40YTUxUXN3cTZCTk1GWkl2TmVDX3NSaG1iVWkzMkk2MHZsMWU0WVVxWFBZYTg?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxPaF9TNWZvLVZkYWRRcGZoU252cFBBUUtsM3dkdE9LSHBkVUh5UFRhUnEyaEdHa21tbmU5SkZRWGhhQmNsTGtBOWM3UnlsVUpLYm5PZFFVdDZ6a09KTFA5MlB4WWRRS3FxSm5uQXA3amEwX2c1bzZ1ZlZTSjlZTnNBUHYxNk9USFVTbXZtcF92YTdCWmFpMjI4VFdvZW94bGI5eDRtY2hjVVN3QQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE4tRkVPS2g4dVlRYURRZ2x6YmZTNEVqOTBqNVc0Nk1UQk1kN1BpWXZiQmRETlN2UUxwckZLQmxad0JQR0F1R3VDTg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxOTGVJM3dIVThPbkNqYXlOYzFhVEIxd1ZidEVWNjZwSzJHM3o0WndJcHlNMHRyVGRKbVVNTHlTMWZ2VWE5Zm9sY2dPS1IxcXh6